WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.050
The English army advances.

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:08.630
The French royal court escaped Paris 
and relocated their royal palace to Chinon.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:14.160
Princess Charlotte stood
 atop the royal court.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:17.820
The king suffered a sudden death, 
and his direct male descendants

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.160
have fallen, one after another, in the war.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:25.580
As a result, the princess, 
a woman, ascended to the throne.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:30.410
Responsibility and loneliness 
weigh heavily on her shoulders.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.320
Charlotte calls out the name...

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.330
the name of a friend with whom 
she exchanged a promise.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.440
Montmorency...

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.270
A saint?

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:47.240
Yeah.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.460
Me?

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.300
Yeah!

00:00:50.020 --> 00:01:00.330
<b>#03 To the Scheming Palace</b>

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:13.570
Jeanne d'Arc and the Alchemist Knight

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.090
"France will be saved by a girl!"

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:27.000
That's the rumor spreading all around France.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.750
The female saint savior 
is the talk of the town

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:33.320
in Paris, Reims, Rouen, and 
just about everywhere else!

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.080
What about this town?

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:37.780
I have a good news for you!

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:40.410
It's not just a rumor!

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.550
Of course, it's just a rumor.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:48.820
But such a rumor would spread only 
because everyone in France is thinking

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:51.770
that the only people who can end this war

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.820
are those blessed by God.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:58.910
God has not abandoned France!

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.400
Archangel Michael was sent to our world

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.930
and has chosen a female saint as savior!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:06.540
No one would believe that!

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:09.790
People tend to believe 
what they want to believe.

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:13.240
They want a female saint to save them.

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:17.680
And if that saint was born as 
a peasant who could speak for them,

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.300
how happy would they be?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:21.300
Allow me to introduce her!

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.430
This girl is the savior of our country!

00:03:26.310 --> 00:03:27.690
I'm counting on you.

00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.810
God commanded the maiden, Jeanne,

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:35.030
"You must save France."

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:39.440
"End the war that has lasted eighty years."

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:41.200
A fairy?

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.810
No, I've never seen or 
heard of a winged fairy!

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:46.330
Does that mean...

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.170
It's an angel!

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:51.330
Yeah, that must be Archangel Michael!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:54.650
Th-Then that girl is the rumored female saint?

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.000
If we gain the support of 
the people along the way,

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:31.370
it would be hard for inquisitors 
to label Jeanne as a heretical witch.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:32.400
Yep.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:36.360
Looks like you have more talent 
as a con artist than as an alchemist.

00:04:36.360 --> 00:04:38.500
It's all thanks to the archangel.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:39.870
An angel?!

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:44.160
I'm the queen that stands 
above all fairy tribes!

00:04:44.160 --> 00:04:46.760
My existence is far greater than an angel!

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:50.020
You sure are tiny for such a great existence.

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:52.770
Don't pat on my head like that!

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:56.200
You think a slave like you can tame me?!

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:58.840
Now that you've become an elixir factory,

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.890
you can no longer become Ulysses.

00:05:00.890 --> 00:05:04.400
Yet, I continue to keep you as a slave,

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.200
so you should show more gratitude!

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.480
Damn! She's just too cute!

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.230
Your addiction to small girls 
is a legitimate disorder.

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.080
Maybe you should see a doctor...

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.290
La Hire was also...

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:23.100
Until her hometown was burned 
down and she lost everyone she loved,

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:26.440
she was a little girl named Étienne.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.550
Must have reminded her of the 
time when she wasn't taintedー

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:34.220
You've got some guts calling me tainted!

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:35.310
Huh?!

00:05:35.310 --> 00:05:37.670
Th-That's not what I meant...

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.150
Montmorency!

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.530
What is it? Why are you still awake?

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:44.070
Um... I have a request.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:48.430
Hey, I consider myself 
to be your older brother.

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:51.050
Little sisters can feel free to ask 
anything from an older brother.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.040
Really?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:52.680
Yeah.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.220
Are you really, really sure?

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:54.950
Yeah.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.460
Then can you give me a baiser?

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.850
I've felt so hot inside, 
ever since we left the village.

00:06:17.850 --> 00:06:19.800
{nodo ga}My throat is all dry.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.810
I was holding back the whole time,

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.310
but I can't stand it any longer!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.490
I want some elixir!

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:32.740
Th-This is a side effect of that idiot 
breaking the Philosopher's Stone in half.

00:06:33.300 --> 00:06:34.510
Under normal circumstances,

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:38.720
elixir replenishment is only needed 
once every few years or few dozen years,

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:41.680
but it looks like Jeanne 
needs it every time she activates

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:44.250
and uses up the power of Ulysses.

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:47.370
In other words, every time 
she turns into Ulysses,

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:51.260
she'll need a baiser with Montmorency!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:52.640
W-Wait!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.600
I can't!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.690
At least do it where others can't see us.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.810
Come on! Open your mouth, Montmorency!

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.360
Montmorency, you bastard!

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.500
You pervert! Lecher!

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:05.150
Don't blame me!

00:07:10.400 --> 00:07:11.900
We have to pass through the forest!

00:07:11.900 --> 00:07:13.660
Don't just stand there, Montmorency!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.020
You have to protect Jeanne!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:21.530
Considering how we've been 
preaching around everywhere...

00:07:21.530 --> 00:07:24.730
It's not a surprise that the 
Burgundy troops would be after us!

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:27.920
All right! Let's go, Jeanne!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.690
Y-You...

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:52.070
It was so sweet and delicious, Montmorency.

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:57.230
I'll hold them off.

00:07:57.230 --> 00:08:00.190
You can only stay as Ulysses for three minutes.

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:01.460
Don't forget that.

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.970
We won't stand a chance fighting her head-on.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:16.740
However, she can only remain 
as Ulysses for three minutes.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.420
She wouldn't take a life, huh?

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.740
Count La Tremoille.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:30.980
What is it?

00:08:31.420 --> 00:08:33.520
We have received a letter 
for Princess Charlotte.

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.940
The sender's name is "Montmorency."

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:38.120
Say it again.

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:40.330
What is the name of the sender?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.360
It's Montmorency...

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.650
I'll keep that.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.580
I'll ask Charlotte to confer 
knighthood upon Jeanne.

00:09:09.240 --> 00:09:11.630
A female saint allying 
with the exiled government

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.240
will boost morale for 
the army and citizens.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:17.100
There may be opportunity to end the war.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:21.960
Montmorency sure has some wild ideas.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.300
Who would've thought he was 
acquainted with the princess?

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:28.440
Just who is he?

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:35.000
Montmorency?

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:40.640
Sorry. It's been seven years 
since I last saw her.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:44.570
I'm sure she'd understand if you 
explained why you couldn't see her.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:46.250
After all, you're friends!

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:47.340
Thanks.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:52.520
But I'm nervous, too.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:57.760
Will the princess really appoint 
a peasant like me as her knight?

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.500
What do you think, Montmorency?

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.270
This way.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:05.240
Um...

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.450
This way.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:35.690
Ow...

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:39.050
Damn! What's going on?

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:40.700
You're...

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:43.350
Richemont?

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.600
Uh, um...

00:11:17.680 --> 00:11:19.320
Your majesty!

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:28.760
Ah... This time, it's a 
self-proclaimed saint, huh?

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:33.820
Self-proclaimed prophet, self-proclaimed 
alchemist, self-proclaimed mage...

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.600
Many self-proclaimed saviors 
have made their way here.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:41.980
Then they knelt before the body double, 
embarrassed themselves,

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:45.760
and proved that they possessed no power.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:47.560
No one will save France...

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.770
or me.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:53.950
Nice to meet you. I'm Jeanne.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.020
I'm from Domremy Village.

00:11:56.020 --> 00:12:01.030
By the way, why is someone other than 
the princess sitting on the throne?

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.700
She saw through the body double!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.760
Is she really a saint?

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:08.140
No, it can't be...

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:10.290
Let's see...

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.040
Oh, you must be the princess!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.920
Please, make me a knight!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.240
It's been seven years.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:39.070
I've heard rumors that you escaped 
on your own from the English army.

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:43.480
I thought you became a general under 
Charlotte's command after that.

00:12:44.080 --> 00:12:45.830
What are you doing here?

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:49.680
I vigilantly investigated 
wrongdoings within the army.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.620
As a result, I was loathed 
by many corrupt nobles,

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:55.060
and ended up here for nonexistent 
crimes that I committed.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:58.430
You've always been like that.

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:00.120
Too serious and turn everyone against youー

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:00.920
Why?

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:04.200
Why didn't you come save me?

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.020
Kill me.

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.300
I like the look in your eyes.

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.620
We're no longer strangers.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.880
Become my knight.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.740
I accepted his offer.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:54.270
France would be annihilated at this rate.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:58.280
Someone will have to play 
the role of a conciliator.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.770
That's what I thought.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:06.170
However, Henry V, who took me in, 
fell ill and passed away.

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:09.500
My plan was ruined.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:14.520
I returned to France as an English knight.

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.090
Then...

00:14:16.610 --> 00:14:22.010
"Regardless of my death, turn all of 
France into an English territory."

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:24.280
Those are the king's last words.

00:14:24.870 --> 00:14:26.670
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.650
There will be no peace negotiations.

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:32.180
We'll need Princess Charlotte 
to be overthrown.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:33.050
But...

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:39.120
By the way, Lady Richemont, 
why don't you become my wife?

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:39.980
Huh?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:42.060
Wh-What are you saying?

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.840
I am about to conquer all of France...

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:51.060
No, even the heavens.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:54.420
You shall be conquered by me, as well.

00:14:57.720 --> 00:15:01.960
That little girl in the 
battlefield sure has grown.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.470
Damn you!

00:15:08.770 --> 00:15:10.520
Guards!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.260
I escaped the English army.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:20.890
Even if I'll be labeled 
as a treacherous knight,

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.650
I had no other choice.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.820
Richemont...

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:33.110
I believed that you would be 
the one who would save me.

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:37.740
Why didn't you come save me?

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.420
What is the matter, ma'am?

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:05.770
Grand Chamberlain of the palace, La Tremoille.

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:08.460
I sensed something was wrong with him, but...

00:16:09.660 --> 00:16:12.250
Something is happening in this castle.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:15.660
It must be why Montmorency 
suddenly disappeared, too.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:21.450
Who would've thought the rumored 
archangel was a rare fairy?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.290
How did you know the one
 on the throne was a body double?

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:33.040
The princess's breasts were bigger, 
even compared to La Hire.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.280
That's what Montmorency told me!

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:37.050
You know Montmorency?!

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.720
Huh? That's strange...

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.900
We're here because we gave 
a letter to the gatekeeper,

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:47.690
and the princess gave us permission to enter.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.520
I didn't get that letter.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.520
Where's Montmorency?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:55.080
W-Well, he disappeared somewhere.

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:57.050
I'm really in a bind.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.260
I see.

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.830
He ran away.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:03.640
Of course he did.

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:06.090
He must be too ashamed to see me.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.800
Your majesty?

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:12.590
He abandoned me, just to play 
around with alchemy at a workshop.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:15.340
He must have already forgotten our promise.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.490
Montmorency isn't someone 
who would break promises.

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:30.100
I never knew alchemy would 
consume my sense of time.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:34.640
I know that's not even an excuse.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.290
I'm a piece of trash that couldn't save you.

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.700
But please believe in this one thing.

00:17:44.570 --> 00:17:46.600
We were chased all around 
France by inquisitors,

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:48.860
and we pathetically ran away the whole time.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.450
But it wasn't because I was scared to die.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:53.890
I had to keep our promise...

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:55.470
Let us swear an oath!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:56.650
We will...

00:17:56.650 --> 00:17:57.950
We will...

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:00.330
...even after we graduate from school...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:02.800
...remain best friends forever!

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.190
To make sure we'll be friends forever,

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:08.380
and to end the war, 
which will get in the way of that...

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.570
That's why I kept running,

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.280
and that's why I came to this castle.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.530
I haven't forgotten that promise.

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:21.350
Okay? Please have faith in Montmorency.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:24.190
Your majesty?

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:28.190
I see... He lost sense of time.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:30.440
Then I can't blame him.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:32.540
Like hell! I can't forgive him!

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:38.600
He has no idea how lonely and scared I was!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.680
If he knew, he wouldn't expect me
 to still have faith in him.

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.720
No one helped me.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:46.540
Even my mother abandoned me!

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:48.330
Your majesty...

00:18:56.060 --> 00:18:57.820
No!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.400
I'm impressed you reacted in time.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:01.840
But your arm has been disabled.

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.620
You think you've won 
because you broke my arm?

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:06.830
Identify yourself.

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:09.960
I'll need your name for your burial!

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.860
I'm Maugris. It's just a nickname, though.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.460
I got rid of my real name 
when I became an assassin!

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.980
You're a monster disguised as a girl!

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:41.160
Is this your first time fighting 
to the death in a confined space?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.860
It's not the same as fighting outside!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.240
It's a whole different game!

00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:45.620
No!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:52.170
You can't even kill a little girl 
without protecting yourself in armor?

00:19:52.170 --> 00:19:56.780
Then I'll just have to crush your dirty armor,
 along with that iron hammer!

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:06.170
If the metal plate was a bit thinner,

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:09.690
I would've squashed your ugly innards!

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:31.620
The Domremy girl reached 
the time limit, as scheduled.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.690
Where are you?

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:35.920
Who's there?

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:39.550
I have sinned, your majesty.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.620
Richemont...

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.060
You!

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.310
Long time no see.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:59.400
I see. So you're the one who
 intercepted my letter to Charlotte.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.570
La Tremoille.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:04.070
I see you're alive and kicking, cousin.

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:07.500
I left the fighting to that man,

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.400
and I was waiting for her to calm down.

00:21:10.400 --> 00:21:11.290
Someone...

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.830
Please quiet down.

